      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YOROKOBI (3) continued his fine run of recent form when a game winner over 2000m at Bordertown last start. Raced on the speed that day and defied all challengers. Won't mind the drop back in distance as the map has him dictating in front. Big chance to keep the ball rolling. STOLEN KISS (4) had not raced for six weeks before her encouraging third over 1400m at Morphettville Parks recently. Won over the mile at Murray Bridge three back so this looks a nice target race with that last run topping her off nicely. GAZELLE (5) has struggled in town since scoring four runs back at Murray Bridge. Draws a nice gate and can return to form in this company. Distance specialist QUEEN BEIRA (2) is in the mix after winning in open company last time. STAR CASINO (1) is not out of contention on a seven-day turnaround.",
